ewlabel{tab:cross_model}{{4}{13}{Cross-model count-curve replication on Few-NERD (text-match recall). Both models show a general declining trend in recall with schema size. Per-batch correlation $r = 0.725$. Qwen3-32B values use the v2 prompt (\S ef {sec:model}) for fair cross-model comparison; the count-curve results in \S ef {sec:count_curves} use the v1 prompt, yielding higher absolute recall (0.72 vs.\ 0.64 at count${}\,=\,1$) due to over-prediction under v1}{table.caption.42}{}}
